              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahithofel odwoko ni, “Kadhi inindi gi mon pa benin ma gi thenge ma go oweyo kuro cel pa kere. Kenyo nyaka kisi nyatoro i Isiraili bino ŋeyo ni benin terin paka jakwor pere, aka ji ma joluwin jobino limo meni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno oger ri Absalom wema i wi cel pa kere, aka Absalom okidho to nindo gi mon pa bamere ma gi thenge odieceŋ par ma kisi nyatoro je neno.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.22"
            ]
          }
        }
